      `the person pulls down, demolishes or removes all or any part of a dwelling-house or other building of which they are in possession or occupation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person severs from the freehold any fixture fixed to it or from the immovable property any movable property permanently attached or joined to the immovable property` IS A BOOLEAN
